### A category the vocabulary does not have — 422 naming the field
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/data/alerts/{{alertId}}
x-hewa-service-token: {{serviceToken}}
x-hewa-write-token: {{writeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "weather"
}

### A null title — 422, so a record of something cannot lose its subject
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/data/alerts/{{alertId}}
x-hewa-service-token: {{serviceToken}}
x-hewa-write-token: {{writeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": null
}

### An alert cannot be deleted — 404
# An alert, a settlement movement and a monitor reading are records of things that happened.
# Deleting one does not correct it, it removes the only trace that it was ever there, and a
# settlement with a missing movement is indistinguishable from one that was never paid. So
# there is no `DELETE` route at all, and the answer is that the path is not there.
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/data/alerts/{{alertId}}
x-hewa-service-token: {{serviceToken}}
x-hewa-write-token: {{writeToken}}

