### Replace the whole movement — 200
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/data/settlements/{{settlementId}}
x-hewa-service-token: {{serviceToken}}
x-hewa-write-token: {{writeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batch": "run-2026-03-01",
  "kind": "clearing",
  "status": "completed",
  "counterparty": "Sahara ISP",
  "amountMinor": 1250000,
